# The deployable site is web/. Deploying from the repository root without this uploads the
# research tree: artifacts/ is 18 GB of checkpoints, runs*/ another 3.6 GB, and data/raw is a
# symlink onto an 11 GB dataset volume.
#
# The leading slash matters. A bare `*` matches at every depth, so it excludes the contents
# of web/ as well as its siblings, and the build then fails with
#   The specified Root Directory "web" does not exist.
# `/*` matches only top-level entries, which is what leaves web/ intact.
/*
!/web
# /paper renders this at build time; it is the source the page must not drift from.
!/paper.md
web/node_modules
web/.next
web/.vercel
